WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.334
How to maintain success?

00:00:05.924 --> 00:00:08.179
So this is a great question that I got from one of my readers

00:00:08.953 --> 00:00:10.374
NOVREHS who wrote in to say

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.341
“Thanks for the video Evan.

00:00:11.532 --> 00:00:12.327
I got a question.

00:00:12.505 --> 00:00:14.158
Is it possible to do a video based

00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:16.363
on how you can maintain success?”

00:00:17.025 --> 00:00:17.754
So this is a great question

00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:19.653
and if you want to maintain success

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:23.228
the key is you need to evolve and innovate.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:25.761
A lot of times, entrepreneurs,

00:00:25.986 --> 00:00:27.811
they start a business, they start seeing some success

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:29.039
they start getting sales

00:00:29.342 --> 00:00:30.637
they start getting market penetration

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:31.821
they start getting market share

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.173
and then you see the companies start to plateau.

00:00:35.612 --> 00:00:37.196
You know, you’re here, you’re just stable

00:00:37.502 --> 00:00:39.227
and then you start seeing the company decline.

00:00:39.861 --> 00:00:41.588
And this happens with most companies.

00:00:42.151 --> 00:00:44.735
Look at how many companies have lasted a hundred years

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.995
or longer and there aren’t that many.

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:49.096
Most companies shut down, they fail

00:00:49.387 --> 00:00:51.068
they can’t transfer to another generation

00:00:51.322 --> 00:00:52.538
they can’t maintain their success

00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:55.763
because they don’t evolve and innovate.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:59.362
The reality is your market is going to change, right?

00:00:59.553 --> 00:01:01.044
You discover a secret, right

00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:03.141
you discover a whole other market

00:01:03.155 --> 00:01:04.258
something that is missing

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:05.824
and you fill it with your product or service.

00:01:06.063 --> 00:01:07.554
That’s great and it works for a while

00:01:07.988 --> 00:01:09.943
but you’ve got to change it over time, right

00:01:10.101 --> 00:01:11.381
you’ve got to continue to add to it because

00:01:11.381 --> 00:01:13.474
the market is going to change

00:01:13.604 --> 00:01:14.462
and if you don’t keep up with it

00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:15.832
you’re company’s going to suffer.

00:01:15.961 --> 00:01:17.722
You can’t keep doing the same thing

00:01:17.915 --> 00:01:20.775
over and over and over and over and over again, okay?

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:24.425
Look at Blockbuster, right, they had the video stores.

00:01:24.781 --> 00:01:28.055
You know, go there, rent a video, bring the DVD back

00:01:29.203 --> 00:01:30.606
and then came along the internet

00:01:30.996 --> 00:01:32.160
and then came along Netflix

00:01:32.629 --> 00:01:35.595
and Blockbuster had the chance to buy Netflix

00:01:36.323 --> 00:01:37.376
and that deal didn’t work out

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:40.470
and now Blockbuster’s out of business.

00:01:41.282 --> 00:01:42.459
They had a great concept.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.219
It was working for a long time

00:01:44.453 --> 00:01:47.042
they made a lot of money but they didn’t innovate or evolve

00:01:47.301 --> 00:01:49.364
and the company went under really quickly

00:01:49.674 --> 00:01:51.030
and that’s what happens to a lot of companies.

00:01:51.468 --> 00:01:54.149
So to get to a successful point is hard enough

00:01:54.487 --> 00:01:56.215
but to maintain it is harder

00:01:56.422 --> 00:01:59.007
because you need to keep innovating and evolving.

00:01:59.842 --> 00:02:01.171
When you don’t do that

00:02:01.397 --> 00:02:02.134
2 things happen

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:05.713
one, as I mention your company suffers, right.

00:02:05.873 --> 00:02:07.115
You stop coming up with new ideas

00:02:07.775 --> 00:02:10.631
and your company starts to stagnate, flat sales

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:11.762
then stars to decline

00:02:12.152 --> 00:02:14.575
but the second part is you become bored.

00:02:15.816 --> 00:02:17.996
You know as an entrepreneur, entrepreneurs,

00:02:18.199 --> 00:02:20.108
we’re addicted to the new, right?

00:02:20.335 --> 00:02:21.626
We come up with new ideas

00:02:21.822 --> 00:02:22.788
we’re the visionaries

00:02:22.991 --> 00:02:25.519
we have this idea of what we want to create

00:02:25.888 --> 00:02:28.343
and then it’s fun to put it into place

00:02:29.332 --> 00:02:30.635
and to start to see it grow.

00:02:30.926 --> 00:02:33.513
We don’t want to just maintain this boring company.

00:02:33.947 --> 00:02:35.435
We want to come up with new things

00:02:35.773 --> 00:02:38.887
and so, when you’re not doing that as a company

00:02:39.119 --> 00:02:41.310
it hurts your business but it also hurts you

00:02:41.551 --> 00:02:44.169
like it hurts your soul as an entrepreneur

00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:46.190
not to be coming up with new things

00:02:46.383 --> 00:02:47.594
to help your customers out.

00:02:48.382 --> 00:02:49.870
So you want to maintain success?

00:02:50.339 --> 00:02:52.599
Continue to evolve and innovate.

00:02:53.065 --> 00:02:53.728
Believe.

00:02:54.295 --> 00:02:55.502
For those of you watching,

00:02:55.665 --> 00:02:56.554
love to know what you think.

00:02:56.754 --> 00:02:57.620
Leave a comment below,

00:02:57.813 --> 00:02:59.681
click on the link in the description to support me.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.640
Click on my face, subscribe to the channel.

00:03:01.929 --> 00:03:03.917
Thank you so much, I’ll see you soon.

